{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて読んでくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントしてくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「16人のプリンシパル」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"in PARCO劇場"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千秋楽。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に二幕に出ることは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"できなかったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく、すごく達成感。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーみんなやり切った。‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この9日間、正直辛かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ここまできました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ汗かいた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ泣いた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ笑った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分は負けず嫌いだし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのスタッフさん、メンバー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何よりみなさんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"支えてくださったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまでできました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんからのメッセージも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アドバイスも、聞こえてくる声援も..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これがなかったら私、だめだった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの言葉に何度励まされたか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度泣いたか、わからない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この期間で本当に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなことを学びました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん反省することもある。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの涙をたくさん見ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「順位にこだわらず、楽しもう」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは胸にとめていたけれど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちにとっては過酷なものでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、これも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乗り越えなきゃいけない壁。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次に繋げよう。おし‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとは成長できたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなポジティブになった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/10/0514528/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...まとまってないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかくとにかくお疲れ様でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/10/0514528/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/10/0514528/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねに会う度泣いてたのは内緒←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"b